    "end": 341.493,
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01",
    "start": 339.114,
    "text": "Where does it stop working?",
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 4932,
    "char_start": 4853,
    "end": 347.892,
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01",
    "start": 341.493,
    "text": "Outside of the RockShox-level tools, it's more difficult to detect the failure.",
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 4999,
    "char_start": 4933,
    "end": 353.238,
    "sent_id": "t0035.s02",
    "start": 347.892,
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5095,
    "char_start": 5000,
    "end": 358.81,
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01",
    "start": 353.238,
    "text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final section to the management of territory.",
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5227,
    "char_start": 5096,
    "end": 367.453,
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01",
    "start": 358.81,
    "text": "That's where the conversation gets interesting, because the issues surrounding land management permeate everything we've discussed.",
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5261,
    "char_start": 5228,
    "end": 369.527,
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01",
    "start": 367.453,
    "text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5334,
    "char_start": 5262,
    "end": 374.051,
    "sent_id": "t0038.s02",
    "start": 369.527,
    "text": "What is the opposing viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5420,
    "char_start": 5335,
    "end": 379.747,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01",
    "start": 374.051,
    "text": "In essence, drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on any trail.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5475,
    "char_start": 5421,
    "end": 383.366,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02",
    "start": 379.747,
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox products.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5565,
    "char_start": 5476,
    "end": 389.33,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s03",
    "start": 383.366,
    "text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5591,
    "char_start": 5566,
    "end": 391.082,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01",
    "start": 389.33,
    "text": "What is the failure mode?",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5653,
    "char_start": 5592,
    "end": 395.356,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02",
    "start": 391.082,
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5748,
    "char_start": 5654,
    "end": 401.791,
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01",
    "start": 395.356,
    "text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that new builders make is excavating with too steep a slope.",
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5827,
    "char_start": 5749,
    "end": 407.13,
    "sent_id": "t0041.s02",
    "start": 401.791,
    "text": "The context is important because it tells you what commitments you are making.",
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5895,
    "char_start": 5828,
    "end": 413.423,
    "sent_id": "t0042.s01",
    "start": 407.13,
    "text": "Before we finish, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
    "unit_id": "t0042.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5960,
    "char_start": 5896,
    "end": 417.657,
    "sent_id": "t0043.s01",
    "start": 413.423,
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and apply it for two weeks.",
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5990,
    "char_start": 5961,
    "end": 419.576,
    "sent_id": "t0043.s02",
    "start": 417.657,
    "text": "Everything else is iteration.",
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6048,
    "char_start": 5991,
    "end": 424.604,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s01",
    "start": 419.576,
    "text": "And to finish, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6121,
    "char_start": 6049,
    "end": 430.956,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s02",
    "start": 424.604,
    "text": "Linear is the issue tracker designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6149,
    "char_start": 6122,
    "end": 433.338,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s03",
    "start": 430.956,
    "text": "Check it out at linear.com.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6201,
    "char_start": 6150,
    "end": 436.779,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s04",
    "start": 433.338,
    "text": "Rafael Vasconcelos, thank you for the conversation.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6221,
    "char_start": 6202,
    "end": 438.813,
    "sent_id": "t0045.s01",
    "start": 436.779,
    "text": "Thank you, Beatriz.",
    "unit_id": "t0045.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6263,
    "char_start": 6222,
    "end": 441.532,
    "sent_id": "t0046.s01",
    "start": 438.813,
    "text": "That's all for today on \"Trail Sessions.\"",
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6282,
    "char_start": 6264,
    "end": 442.726,
    "sent_id": "t0046.s02",
